📜 [GitHub Release Notes](https://github.com/scalameta/mdoc/releases/tag/v2.6.4) - [Version Diff](https://github.com/scalameta/mdoc/compare/v2.6.2...v2.6.4)

## Usage
✅ **Please merge!**

I'll automatically update this PR to resolve conflicts as long as you don't change it yourself.

If you'd like to skip this version, you can just close this PR. If you have any feedback, just mention me in the comments below.

Configure Scala Steward for your repository with a [`.scala-steward.conf`](https://github.com/scala-steward-org/scala-steward/blob/8929fadb6f535472bd63397b1cb55a835fa1b5cb/docs/repo-specific-configuration.md) file.

_Have a fantastic day writing Scala!_

